Rips_SetReferrerFrozen
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
├── when the referrer is the zero address
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner and referrer is not the zero address
    ├── it should update the frozen status.
    └── it should emit a {ReferrerFreezeUpdated} event.
